+# channel-verify <v1.5.0 .app> --expect stable        → GitHub, up to date
+# channel-verify <v1.5.0-beta.10 .app> --expect beta  → beta, GitHub, latest 1.5.0-beta.10, …/v1.5.0-beta.10/WhatCable.zip
+# channel-verify <v0.5.14 .app> --expect stable       → GitHub, UPDATE → 1.5.0, download = releases 页（仅检测）
